(>> Solution to Question 1:) Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Explain Strings as Compound Data Types in Python. Detail string traversal algorithms using for and while loops, character length determination, and memory immutability.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Theoretical Foundations of Strings as Compound Types:) Tj
T*
(   In computer science, a compound data type is one constructed from smaller, fundamental) Tj
T*
(   components.) Tj
T*
(   In Python, the str type is an ordered, immutable sequence of Unicode code points.) Tj
T*
(   Key Architectural Properties:) Tj
T*
(   - Homogeneous Interface: Every character is accessed as a single-character string \(Python has) Tj
T*
(   no separate 'char' type\).) Tj
T*
(   - Immutability: Once allocated on the heap, the UTF-8/Latin-1/UCS-4 byte buffer cannot be) Tj
T*
(   mutated in place.) Tj
T*
(   - Sequential Indexing: Characters are indexed from 0 to len\(s\) - 1, and backward from -1 to) Tj
T*
(   -len\(s\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Traversal Paradigms:) Tj
T*
(   1. Iterator Traversal \(Idiomatic\): for char in s: Directly yields code points in O\(N\) time.) Tj
T*
(   2. Index-Based Traversal: for i in range\(len\(s\)\): Enables positional indexing and lookaheads.) Tj
T*
(   3. While-Loop Traversal: Explicit pointer advancement with custom boundary checks.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Python Implementation & Demonstration:) Tj
T*
(   def traverse_and_analyze_string\(text: str\):) Tj
T*
(   """Demonstrate string traversal and character categorization.""") Tj
T*
(   vowel_count = 0) Tj
T*
(   consonant_count = 0) Tj
T*
(   digit_count = 0) Tj
T*
(   special_count = 0) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   vowels = set\("aeiouAEIOU"\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # Traversal using idiomatic for-in loop) Tj
T*
(   for char in text:) Tj
T*
(   if char.isdigit\(\):) Tj
T*
(   digit_count += 1) Tj
T*
(   elif char.isalpha\(\):) Tj
T*
(   if char in vowels:) Tj
T*
(   vowel_count += 1) Tj
T*
(   else:) Tj
T*
(   consonant_count += 1) Tj
T*
(   else:) Tj
T*
(   special_count += 1) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   return {) Tj
T*
(   "TotalLength": len\(text\),) Tj
T*
(   "Vowels": vowel_count,) Tj
T*
(   "Consonants": consonant_count,) Tj
T*
(   "Digits": digit_count,) Tj
T*
(   "SpecialChars": special_count) Tj
T*
(   }) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # Execution) Tj
T*
ET

endstream
