T*
(   4. Memory Model & Execution Trace:) Tj
T*
(   - Stack: text -> Heap [PyUnicodeObject: length=33, state=compact_ascii, buffer='CSE-Python...']) Tj
T*
(   - Each char during iteration is a transient reference to interned single-character string) Tj
T*
(   singletons in CPython memory.) Tj
T*
(   - No in-place modification occurs; total allocated buffer remains constant.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   5. Complexity Analysis:) Tj
T*
(   - Time Complexity: O\(N\) linear time single pass over N characters.) Tj
T*
(   - Space Complexity: O\(1\) auxiliary counter storage.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
