(>> Solution to Question 3:) Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Discuss String Searching and Transformation Methods: find\(\), index\(\), count\(\), replace\(\), split\(\), join\(\), and strip\(\). Explain exceptions vs sentinel returns.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. String Inspection & Search Methods:) Tj
T*
(   - str.find\(sub[, start[, end]]\): Scans for substring sub. Returns lowest 0-based index if) Tj
T*
(   found; returns -1 sentinel if absent \(Never raises an exception\).) Tj
T*
(   - str.index\(sub[, start[, end]]\): Identical to find\(\), but raises a ValueError exception if sub) Tj
T*
(   is absent. Used when absence signifies a fatal logic error.) Tj
T*
(   - str.count\(sub[, start[, end]]\): Returns number of non-overlapping occurrences of sub.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. String Transformation & Sanitization Methods:) Tj
T*
(   - str.replace\(old, new[, count]\): Returns a new string with occurrences of old replaced by new.) Tj
T*
(   - str.split\(sep=None, maxsplit=-1\): Splits string on separator into a list of substrings. If) Tj
T*
(   sep is None, splits on arbitrary contiguous whitespace.) Tj
T*
(   - str.join\(iterable\): Concatenates elements of an iterable using str as separator in O\(N\) time.) Tj
T*
(   - str.strip\([chars]\): Strips leading and trailing whitespace or specified characters.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Python Code Demonstration:) Tj
T*
(   def string_utility_pipeline\(raw_log: str\):) Tj
T*
(   """Sanitize, parse, and reformat a raw server log entry.""") Tj
T*
(   # 1. Strip edge padding) Tj
T*
(   cleaned = raw_log.strip\(\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # 2. Check presence using find vs index) Tj
T*
(   if cleaned.find\("ERROR"\) != -1:) Tj
T*
(   log_level = "CRITICAL") Tj
T*
(   else:) Tj
T*
(   log_level = "INFO") Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # 3. Replace delimiters and split tokens) Tj
T*
(   normalized = cleaned.replace\("|", ";"\)) Tj
T*
(   tokens = [t.strip\(\) for t in normalized.split\(";"\)]) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # 4. Join into structured CSV format) Tj
T*
(   csv_line = ",".join\(tokens\)) Tj
T*
(   return {"Level": log_level, "Tokens": tokens, "CSV": csv_line}) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   sample_log = " 2026-10-26 | ERROR | DatabaseConnectionTimeout | Host=192.168.1.50 ") Tj
T*
(   parsed = string_utility_pipeline\(sample_log\)) Tj
T*
(   print\("Pipeline Output:", parsed\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Complexity Analysis:) Tj
T*
ET

