12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Explain List Slicing, Slice Assignment, Deletion \(del, remove, pop, clear\), and Element Access with Negative Indexing.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. List Indexing and Boundaries:) Tj
T*
(   List elements are accessed in O\(1\) time via L[i] by dereferencing the pointer ob_item[i].) Tj
T*
(   Negative index L[-k] resolves to L[len\(L\) - k]. Attempting to access an index outside [-len\(L\),) Tj
T*
(   len\(L\) - 1] raises an IndexError.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Advanced Slice Assignment:) Tj
T*
(   Unlike strings which are immutable, lists support slice assignment:) Tj
T*
(   - L[start:stop] = iterable replaces the targeted slice range with elements from the iterable,) Tj
T*
(   even if lengths differ!) Tj
T*
(   - L[i:i] = iterable inserts elements at index i without deleting any items.) Tj
T*
(   - L[::2] = iterable performs extended slice assignment \(requires matching lengths\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Deletion Strategies Comparison:) Tj
T*
(   1. del L[i]: Deletes item at index i by shifting subsequent pointers leftward in O\(N - i\) time.) Tj
T*
(   2. L.pop\([i]\): Removes and returns element at index i \(default last item in O\(1\) time\).) Tj
T*
(   3. L.remove\(val\): Searches for first occurrence of val and removes it. Raises ValueError if) Tj
T*
(   absent. O\(N\) time.) Tj
T*
(   4. L.clear\(\): Empties list completely in O\(1\) time \(equivalent to del L[:]\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Python Code Demonstration:) Tj
T*
(   data = [10, 20, 30, 40, 50, 60]) Tj
T*
(   print\(f"Initial List: {data}"\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # Slice replacement with different size) Tj
T*
(   data[1:4] = [99, 100] # Replaces [20, 30, 40] with [99, 100]) Tj
T*
(   print\(f"After Slice Assignment data[1:4]=[99, 100]: {data}"\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # In-place insertion via zero-width slice) Tj
T*
(   data[2:2] = ['A', 'B']) Tj
T*
(   print\(f"After Zero-Width Slice Insertion: {data}"\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # Pop and Remove) Tj
T*
(   popped_val = data.pop\(\) # Removes 60) Tj
T*
(   print\(f"Popped Last Item: {popped_val} | List: {data}"\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   data.remove\('A'\)) Tj
T*
(   print\(f"After data.remove\('A'\): {data}"\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   del data[0]) Tj
T*
(   print\(f"After del data[0]: {data}"\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   5. Complexity Analysis:) Tj
T*
ET

