BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Discuss Dictionary Methods: get\(\), keys\(\), values\(\), items\(\), update\(\), setdefault\(\), and Dictionary Comprehensions with practical applications.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Core Dictionary Methods Inventory:) Tj
T*
(   - dict.get\(key, default=None\): Returns value for key; returns default if key is not found) Tj
T*
(   \(Prevents KeyError\).) Tj
T*
(   - dict.setdefault\(key, default\): If key is in dict, returns its value. If not, inserts key with) Tj
T*
(   value default and returns default.) Tj
T*
(   - dict.update\([other]\): Merges key-value pairs from another dictionary or iterable, overwriting) Tj
T*
(   existing keys in-place.) Tj
T*
(   - dict.keys\(\): Returns a dynamic dict_keys view object reflecting real-time dictionary keys.) Tj
T*
(   - dict.values\(\): Returns a dynamic dict_values view object.) Tj
T*
(   - dict.items\(\): Returns a dynamic dict_items view of \(key, value\) pairs.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Dictionary Comprehensions:) Tj
T*
(   Syntax: {key_expr: value_expr for item in iterable if condition}) Tj
T*
(   Enables declarative transformation, filtering, and inversion of mappings.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Python Implementation & Demonstration:) Tj
T*
(   # 1. Frequency Counter using setdefault vs get) Tj
T*
(   text = "apple orange banana apple banana apple") Tj
T*
(   freq_map = {}) Tj
T*
(   for word in text.split\(\):) Tj
T*
(   freq_map[word] = freq_map.get\(word, 0\) + 1) Tj
T*
(   print\(f"Word Frequencies via get\(\): {freq_map}"\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # 2. Dictionary Inversion using Dictionary Comprehension) Tj
T*
(   # Inverting mapping: Department -> List of Employees) Tj
T*
(   org = {"Engineering": "Aarav", "Marketing": "Priya", "Research": "Meera"}) Tj
T*
(   inverted_org = {employee: dept for dept, employee in org.items\(\)}) Tj
T*
(   print\(f"Inverted Org Mapping: {inverted_org}"\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # 3. Filtering Dictionary via Comprehension) Tj
T*
(   high_freq = {k: v for k, v in freq_map.items\(\) if v >= 2}) Tj
T*
(   print\(f"High Frequency Words \(count >= 2\): {high_freq}"\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # 4. Dictionary Merging using | operator \(Python 3.9+\)) Tj
T*
(   defaults = {"theme": "light", "notifications": True, "fontSize": 12}) Tj
T*
(   user_pref = {"theme": "dark", "fontSize": 14}) Tj
T*
(   final_config = defaults | user_pref # user_pref overrides defaults) Tj
T*
(   print\(f"Merged Final Configuration: {final_config}"\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Complexity Analysis:) Tj
T*
(   - get\(\) / setdefault\(\): O\(1\) average lookup/insert.) Tj
T*
(   - Dictionary Comprehension: O\(N\) linear time.) Tj
T*
(   - Space Complexity: O\(N\) memory for created dictionary.) Tj
T*
ET

endstream
