(   [Problem Statement]: Implement a Stack and Queue Data Structure in Python using list vs collections.deque. Benchmark pop\(0\) vs popleft\(\) performance.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Data Structure Mechanics:) Tj
T*
(   - Stack: Last-In-First-Out \(LIFO\). Supported natively by list via append\(\) \(push\) and pop\(\)) Tj
T*
(   \(pop\) in O\(1\) time.) Tj
T*
(   - Queue: First-In-First-Out \(FIFO\). Requires enqueue at one end and dequeue at opposite end.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. The Python List Pop\(0\) Performance Trap:) Tj
T*
(   In Python list, pop\(0\) removes the first pointer, forcing CPython to shift all remaining N - 1) Tj
T*
(   pointers in memory leftward via memmove\(\), incurring O\(N\) linear time overhead.) Tj
T*
(   Using a list as a queue leads to disastrous O\(N^2\) cumulative performance!) Tj
T*
(   collections.deque \(Double-Ended Queue\) is implemented as a doubly linked list of fixed-size) Tj
T*
(   memory blocks \(64 elements each\). Both append\(\) and popleft\(\) run in strictly O\(1\) time without) Tj
T*
(   pointer shifting!) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Python Code Demonstration & Micro-Benchmark:) Tj
T*
(   import time) Tj
T*
(   from collections import deque) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   def benchmark_queue_performance\(n=50_000\):) Tj
T*
(   # Benchmark 1: list.pop\(0\) - O\(N\)) Tj
T*
(   lst_q = list\(range\(n\)\)) Tj
T*
(   start_t = time.perf_counter\(\)) Tj
T*
(   while lst_q:) Tj
T*
(   lst_q.pop\(0\)) Tj
T*
(   list_elapsed = time.perf_counter\(\) - start_t) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # Benchmark 2: deque.popleft\(\) - O\(1\)) Tj
T*
(   deq_q = deque\(range\(n\)\)) Tj
T*
(   start_t = time.perf_counter\(\)) Tj
T*
(   while deq_q:) Tj
T*
(   deq_q.popleft\(\)) Tj
T*
(   deque_elapsed = time.perf_counter\(\) - start_t) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   print\(f"Benchmark: Dequeuing {n:,} items:"\)) Tj
T*
(   print\(f" list.pop\(0\) [O\(N\)] Time: {list_elapsed:.4f} seconds"\)) Tj
T*
(   print\(f" deque.popleft\(\) [O\(1\)] Time: {deque_elapsed:.6f} seconds"\)) Tj
T*
(   print\(f" Speedup Factor: {list_elapsed / deque_elapsed:.1f}x faster!"\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   benchmark_queue_performance\(30_000\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Complexity Analysis:) Tj
T*
(   - list.pop\(0\) Time Complexity: O\(N\).) Tj
T*
(   - deque.popleft\(\) Time Complexity: O\(1\).) Tj
T*
